# React UI

- MUI 9 + emotion; theme in `src/theme.ts`.
- Invoke backend: `invoke<ScanReport>('scan_repo', { repoPath, profile })`; listen `scan-progress`.
- Pages: `src/pages/*` (Score, Issues, Charts, Browse, Settings). Dark theme only.
- Folder pick: `@tauri-apps/plugin-dialog` `open({ directory: true })`.
- Split charts/tables into `src/components/`; keep `App.tsx` orchestration-only.
- `ScanSummary` shapes come from `src/types/scan.ts` — update when Rust types change.

Verify with `pnpm build` before committing UI work.